# Control-plane optional independent deploy — ADR-09 BOUNDARY B
# Status: wording + flags only. Co-deploy remains production default.
# NOT compose long-running. Do NOT invent a second Identity/PolicyGate.
# See reports/five-products/ADR09_CONTROL_PLANE_BOUNDARY.md
#
# Copy (only if running an optional control-plane-focused process):
#   cp control_plane_optional.env.example .env.control-plane-optional

# Optional home (default ~/.aiplat when unset)
# AIPLAT_HOME=/tmp/aiplat-control-plane-optional

# BOUNDARY C one-shot health (phase_health.sh sets these; leave unset for co-deploy)
# AIPLAT_CONTROL_PLANE_OPTIONAL_SPLIT=1
# ADR09_CONTROL_PLANE_HEALTH_PORT=18768
# ADR09_CONTROL_PLANE_AIPLAT_HOME=/tmp/aiplat-control-plane-optional
